## Full Paper LaTeX (current state)

### main.tex

\documentclass[11pt,a4paper]{article}
\usepackage[review]{acl}
\usepackage{times,latexsym}
\usepackage{amsmath,amssymb}
\usepackage{graphicx}
\graphicspath{{../../figures/paper/}}
\usepackage{booktabs}
